{"batchcomplete":true,"query":{"pages":[{"pageid":12746,"ns":0,"title":"Generalization","extract":"A generalization is a form of abstraction whereby common properties of specific instances are formulated as general concepts or claims. Generalizations posit the existence of a domain or set of elements, as well as one or more common characteristics shared by those elements (thus creating a conceptual model).","description":"Form of abstraction","descriptionsource":"local"}]}}